    <section class="empire-glance" id="at-a-glance" aria-labelledby="glance-title">
      <div class="empire-glance-main"><h2 class="empire-glance-title" id="glance-title">At a glance</h2><ul><li>A state owned personally by King <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/leopold-ii">Leopold II of Belgium</a>, recognised at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/berlin-conference">Berlin Conference</a> and proclaimed in 1885.</li><li>Forced collection of wild <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rubber">rubber</a>, enforced by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/force-publique">Force Publique</a> through hostage-taking and mutilation, caused mass death.</li><li>An international campaign led by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/roger-casement">Roger Casement</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/e-d-morel">E. D. Morel</a> forced <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/belgium">Belgium</a> to annex it as the Belgian Congo in 1908.</li></ul></div>
      <aside class="empire-dyk"><p class="empire-dyk-title">Did you know?</p><p><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/leopold-ii">Leopold II</a> ruled the Congo Free State for twenty-three years without ever setting foot in it, governing by decree from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/brussels">Brussels</a>.</p></aside>
    </section>

